msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "Provides rich media info and artwork to skins."
msgstr "为皮肤提供丰富的媒体信息和艺术图。"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "Skin Info Service provides skins with rich metadata and artwork beyond what Kodi exposes by default. It adds extra properties such as ratings from multiple sources, artwork, stream details, and cast and plot information for movies, TV shows, episodes, sets, music videos, artists, and albums, drawing on both your library and online data. It also includes a tool to find and add animated GIF posters to your library."
msgstr "皮肤信息服务为皮肤提供超出 Kodi 默认范围的丰富元数据和艺术图。它添加了多种额外属性,例如来自多个来源的评分、艺术图、流媒体详情,以及电影、电视剧、剧集、合集、音乐视频、艺术家和专辑的演员阵容和剧情信息,数据来源包括您的媒体库和在线数据。它还包含一个工具,用于查找并向您的媒体库添加动画 GIF 海报。"

msgctxt "Addon Disclaimer"
msgid "This add-on uses TMDB and the TMDB APIs but is not endorsed, certified, or otherwise approved by TMDB."
msgstr ""

